      en: ["The plantations are irrigated using water from the Bandama River.", "SUCAF produces over 100,000 tonnes of sugar annually.", "The company employs thousands of seasonal workers during the harvest season.", "The factory generates part of its electricity from bagasse (sugarcane residue).", "Ferkessédougou I and II are the two main sites.", "SUCAF operates its own research station for sugarcane varieties."],
